<title>THAILAND: Trading in Jalaprathan to resume-bourse.</title>
<headline>Trading in Jalaprathan to resume-bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand said it had lifted suspension of Jalaprathan Cement Plc shares and trading would resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement it had suspended the company's shares on Wednesday pending details about its capital increase plan and the details had now been received.</p>
</text>
